# Resilience Patterns

> **Advisory** — This document is generated by arbiter for `backend-web-db` projects at L2+.
> It prescribes the recommended defaults. Override where your service's SLA/SLO demands differ.

## Defaults at a glance

| Pattern | Default |
|---------|---------|
| Retry attempts | 3 (including initial) |
| Initial backoff | 1 s |
| Max backoff cap | 30 s |
| Backoff multiplier | 2× |
| Jitter | 50 % randomised |
| Retry on | 5xx + connection/timeout only — **never 4xx** |
| Circuit-breaker threshold | 50 % failure rate |
| Circuit-breaker min-calls | 10 |
| CB decorator order | CB wraps retry (CB sees final outcome) |
| Per-attempt timeout | 5 s |
| Rate-limiter (token bucket) | 100 req/s sustained, burst 20, per-client key |

