## L3/L4 enforcement

At governance level `<%= governanceLevel %>` the following are hard requirements in addition to
the advisory defaults above:

- **Circuit-breaker metrics exported** — CB state (open/closed/half-open) + failure rate must
  be observable via the service's metrics endpoint (Prometheus/Micrometer scrape target).
- **Retry count metric** — instrument retry attempts per target with a labelled counter.
- **Runbook linked** — each CB instance must have a corresponding runbook entry describing
  the escalation path when it opens and remains open beyond the alert threshold.
- **Load-test evidence** — the retry+CB policy must be exercised under simulated failure
  conditions (e.g. Toxiproxy/Chaos Monkey) and the CB-open event must appear in traces.

